<p>Hi there <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mastermindartemis" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2877004); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2877004&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1568406928" alt="mastermindartemis" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2877004)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mastermindartemis" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2877004); return false;">mastermindartemis</a></span>, thanks for leaving your thoughts.</p>
<p>This is an SCP article, it’s just not written in the typical Item #, Object Class, Containment Procedures, Description, and Addendum format. I wrote the article this way because I felt that the story would be more impactful from a first person perspective.</p>
<p>I considered writing it as a tale, but at the end of the day, that’s not how I wanted to tell the story, because putting it in an article opposed to a tale actually does matter to the narrative.</p>
<p>Thanks again for leaving your thoughts.</p>

